<title>UK: NTT sets 100 bln yen 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>NTT sets 100 bln yen 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NIPPON TELEGRAPH AND TELEPHONE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    100 BLN YEN   COUPON     2.50	MATURITY    25.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.044    PAY DATE    25.JUL.97</p>
<p>			    REOFFER    99.044    SPREAD	+4 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LON	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 194 JGB</p>
